{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日下午4時45分發出偏北強風警告，提醒市民注意即時天氣情況。本港現時吹偏北強風，海面可能出現大浪，對海上活動構成潛在危險。市民應避免前往海邊或進行水上活動，並確保家中窗戶及門戶緊閉，以減少強風可能帶來的影響。\n</p>\n<p>此外，駕駛人士需特別留意道路安全，尤其是在高地或橋樑附近，因強風可能影響車輛穩定性。天文台建議市民密切留意最新天氣報告，並採取必要的安全措施以保障自身及家人安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b7%e9%a2%a8%e8%ad%a6%e5%91%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">強風警告</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 9 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.001869+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:15:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:51.046232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.180439+00:00","content_hash":"71882a00afdee98c53201b63ec367cc626b322d09158ae16786b1029566aa36f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}